                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11 N 15/145: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-17T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                                1928—noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>161. Your 348, May 14, 5 p.m. Presbyterian Mission Board meeting May 14 has
                    declined to approve. Department approves your nomination of Lyman.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
